OL,5,G1915 The Curse
OL,6,     FFor generations, The Newfoundland
OL,7,     FCurse has caused young, seemingly
OL,8,     Fhealthy men to die suddenly. Can
OL,9,     Fresearch stop this genetic
OL,10,     Fmutation that's terrorised
OL,11,     Ffamilies for centuries?
